export anchor TubeAmpStyle:
    number: 310
    screen: OpsMonitor
    name: Tube amp
    idea: A vintage amplifier faceplate on dark tolex, a row of glowing tubes for the services, analog VU meters for traffic, errors and latency, a chart recorder, a jewel warning lamp for the incident and engraved small caps labels.
    base: dark
    palette:
        tolex: #15100c, the textured page behind the amp
        faceplate: #2a2119, the header plate, swatches and the secondary button
        bay: #211a14, section bays
        tag: #1a140f, tube tags, fields and the recorder
        cream: #f3e6c8, engraved text, meter scales and p95
        muted: #cdbb98, secondary labels
        brass: #d6ae62, the logo, bay titles, times and the primary button
        rule: #5a4a38, borders and dashed rules
        amber: #ffbf5e, tube glow, the requests line, Degraded and the incident
        mint: #9be29a, Healthy and Resolved
        sky: #9fd4ff, Recovered and p50
        coral: #ff8a6a, the meter red zone, the error line and Firing
        focus: #ffe7a8, the focus outline
    type:
        Engraved labels in Iowan Old Style, Palatino Linotype, Palatino,
        Georgia as small caps tracked 0.12 to 0.16em, and text in Gill Sans,
        Optima, Trebuchet MS, system-ui at 15px. The logo is 30px italic
        serif bold in brass, the incident number 20px serif bold amber, bay
        titles 16px serif small caps, service names 14px mono bold.
    layout:
        A rounded header faceplate with brass screws holds the italic
        Brightwork logo over Ops production 24 hours, the apps as jacks
        that light amber for Ops, and a glowing pilot lamp marked Power on,
        with the description below. Bays follow on the tolex. Service tubes
        shows five drawn tubes in a row, each glowing warm, the
        sync-worker tube dimmer with flicker marks, and under each a tag
        with the name, status shape and word, uptime and metric. Meters
        shows three VU meters with a cream scale, a coral red zone, a white
        needle at the current value and a gold peak mark, for requests per
        minute, error rate and p95 latency, each with a small caps caption
        and a note. Chart recorder draws the four series over 24 hours on a
        dark gridded strip with a legend. Three bays close the screen, the
        warning lamp with an amber jewel beside the incident facts, alerts
        and deploys. Below 980px tubes go three across and meters stack,
        and at phone width tubes go two across.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 20px bay padding and gaps, 16px between tubes, 24px page padding.
    density: Roomy. Tubes and meters take most of the space.
    corners: 16px faceplate, 12px bays, 10px meter frames, 6px tags, round jacks and pill buttons.
    borders: A 2px dark brass edge on the faceplate, 1px #5a4a38 bays, dashed list rules.
    shadows: A deep faceplate shadow, warm tube, lamp and jack glows, brass screw heads.
    icons:
        16px status shapes on tube tags and lists, a ringed tick for
        Healthy, a triangle for Degraded, a circular arrow for Recovered, a
        bolt for Firing, a tick for Resolved and a magnifier for
        Investigating. Lit and unlit jacks mark the apps.
    focus: A 3px pale gold outline offset 3px.
    tone: Warm hardware words, such as Power on, Service tubes, Meters, Chart recorder and Warning lamp.
